{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "35630fd5-464b-862f-abf1-4bbd6a7df15d",
  "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:43:55-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Isabel S. Furtado",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T08:42:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T08:42:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. I would like to inquire about purchasing a memorial bench at one of the city's beach parks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T08:42:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sure, we get those requests. Do you have a particular park in mind?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T08:42:33-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would prefer one of the beach areas, if that is permitted. I am sorry, my phone volume is too low and I keep adjusting it. Could you speak up a little?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T08:42:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, is this better? I'll talk louder."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T08:42:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is much better, thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T08:42:51-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. So generally the bench program has a list of approved locations, and the department reviews each request. Placement depends on what's available at the site and whether there's a plaque wording to approve."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T08:43:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. And is there a waiting period, or a form that I must complete?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T08:43:09-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's an application, yes. I can mail it or email it to you, or I can take your information and have someone from our office follow up about the available spots."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T08:43:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Before that, I would like to ask whether there is a web page with the same information. I would prefer to read it first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T08:43:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, there is. If you go to the city website and look under the Recreation Department, there's a section for park benches and memorials. The application should be there too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T08:43:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, and then the section on benches and memorials. Thank you, I have that written down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T08:43:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. And if you have questions after you read it, just call us back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T08:43:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you for your help. Good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T08:43:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, bye now."
    }
  ],
